  "name": "migrating-from-fivetran",
  "description": "Move a user's Fivetran connectors into PostHog data warehouse sources. Use when the user says \"migrate from Fivetran\", \"import my Fivetran setup\", \"replace Fivetran with PostHog\", or asks what of their Fivetran account PostHog can take over. Reads the Fivetran account with a read-only key or through the user's Fivetran MCP server, reports which connections move as they are, which move with caveats, and which PostHog cannot take yet, then creates the PostHog sources one at a time while the user enters only the secrets.",
